{
  "contract": "ori-specs/gateway-api/v2.md#reading-status-while-runtimes-adopt-runtime-healthv4",
  "version": 2,
  "comment": "Golden vectors for reading the health export's status while runtimes adopt runtime-health/v4. Each case is items[0] of a verified health export response and whether the gateway has read a marked item before from requested_device_id, the device the export was requested from. A gateway must read each case as the severity given, and hold or not hold the device's latch afterwards as given.",
